{"seq":1,"slug":"rate-limiting-throttling","title":"限流与节流策略：网关如何控制请求速率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/resilience/rate-limiting-throttling","wordCount":785,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"限流与节流策略-网关如何控制请求速率\">限流与节流策略：网关如何控制请求速率</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>限流（Rate Limiting）</strong></td>\n<td>限制调用方在时间窗口内的请求数量，超出则拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>节流（Throttling）</strong></td>\n<td>延迟处理过量请求而非直接拒绝，更友好但更复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>令牌桶（Token Bucket）</strong></td>\n<td>允许短暂突发（桶满时），稳定消耗速率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>漏桶（Leaky Bucket）</strong></td>\n<td>以固定速率&quot;漏&quot;请求，强制平滑，不允许突发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>滑动窗口计数器</strong></td>\n<td>比固定窗口更精确，避免边界时刻的突发问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么要在网关限流\">为什么要在网关限流？</h2><p>没有限流的 API 面临的风险：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>恶意滥用</strong>：爬虫、DDoS 攻击、暴力破解登录接口</li>\n<li><strong>客户端 bug</strong>：失控的重试循环（retry storm）打垮后端</li>\n<li><strong>资源不公平</strong>：单个高频调用方耗尽所有配额，影响其他用户</li>\n<li><strong>级联故障</strong>：一个服务响应慢，上游不断重试，流量雪崩</li>\n</ol>\n<p>网关集中限流的优势是<strong>全局视野</strong>：无论请求通过哪个网关实例，速率计数都在共享存储（Redis）中维护，实现真正的全局限速。</p>\n<h2 id=\"限流算法对比\">限流算法对比</h2><h3 id=\"固定窗口计数器\">固定窗口计数器</h3><p>最简单的实现：每分钟重置计数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"时间窗口: 0-60秒&#10;限制: 100 req/min&#10;&#10;请求1-100: 允许（计数 = 100）&#10;请求101: 拒绝（超出限制）&#10;60秒时: 计数重置为 0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>时间窗口: 0-60秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>限制: 100 req/min</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>请求1-100: 允许（计数 = 100）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>请求101: 拒绝（超出限制）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>60秒时: 计数重置为 0</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>问题</strong>：边界突发。用户可以在 59 秒发 100 个请求，60 秒又发 100 个，实际 2 秒内 200 个请求，远超预期。</p>\n<h3 id=\"滑动窗口计数器-sliding-window-log\">滑动窗口计数器（Sliding Window Log）</h3><p>记录每个请求的时间戳，统计最近 60 秒内的请求数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"当前时间: T&#10;统计 [T-60s, T] 窗口内的请求数\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>当前时间: T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>统计 [T-60s, T] 窗口内的请求数</span></span></code></pre></div><p>精确但内存开销大（每个请求存一条记录）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"令牌桶-token-bucket\">令牌桶（Token Bucket）</h3><p>桶以固定速率（rate）填充令牌，最多填满桶容量（burst）。每个请求消耗一个令牌。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"burst = 10（允许短暂突发 10 个请求）&#10;rate = 2/s（每秒补充 2 个令牌）&#10;&#10;t=0: 桶满 10 个令牌&#10;t=0-4s: 10 个请求同时来，全部通过（消耗 10 个令牌）&#10;t=4s: 桶空，下个请求等待&#10;t=4.5s: 桶中有 1 个令牌，允许 1 个请求\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>burst = 10（允许短暂突发 10 个请求）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>rate = 2/s（每秒补充 2 个令牌）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>t=0: 桶满 10 个令牌</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>t=0-4s: 10 个请求同时来，全部通过（消耗 10 个令牌）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>t=4s: 桶空，下个请求等待</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>t=4.5s: 桶中有 1 个令牌，允许 1 个请求</span></span></code></pre></div><p>令牌桶允许合理的突发流量（填满时），同时长期维持平均速率。是大多数 API 限流的推荐算法。</p>\n<h3 id=\"redis-lua-的令牌桶实现\">Redis + Lua 的令牌桶实现</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- rate_limit.lua&#10;local key = KEYS[1]&#10;local rate = tonumber(ARGV[1])       -- 每秒填充速率（tokens/s）&#10;local burst = tonumber(ARGV[2])      -- 桶容量（最大 tokens）&#10;local now = tonumber(ARGV[3])        -- 当前时间戳（毫秒）&#10;&#10;local last_tokens = tonumber(redis.call(&#39;HGET&#39;, key, &#39;tokens&#39;) or burst)&#10;local last_ts = tonumber(redis.call(&#39;HGET&#39;, key, &#39;ts&#39;) or now)&#10;&#10;-- 计算新增令牌&#10;local elapsed = math.max(0, (now - last_ts) / 1000.0)&#10;local new_tokens = math.min(burst, last_tokens + elapsed * rate)&#10;&#10;if new_tokens &gt;= 1 then&#10;    -- 有令牌，允许通过&#10;    redis.call(&#39;HSET&#39;, key, &#39;tokens&#39;, new_tokens - 1, &#39;ts&#39;, now)&#10;    redis.call(&#39;PEXPIRE&#39;, key, 60000)&#10;    return 1  -- 允许&#10;else&#10;    -- 桶空，拒绝&#10;    redis.call(&#39;HSET&#39;, key, &#39;tokens&#39;, new_tokens, &#39;ts&#39;, now)&#10;    return 0  -- 拒绝&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- rate_limit.lua</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local key = KEYS[1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local rate = tonumber(ARGV[1])       -- 每秒填充速率（tokens/s）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local burst = tonumber(ARGV[2])      -- 桶容量（最大 tokens）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local now = tonumber(ARGV[3])        -- 当前时间戳（毫秒）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local last_tokens = tonumber(redis.call('HGET', key, 'tokens') or burst)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local last_ts = tonumber(redis.call('HGET', key, 'ts') or now)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 计算新增令牌</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local elapsed = math.max(0, (now - last_ts) / 1000.0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local new_tokens = math.min(burst, last_tokens + elapsed * rate)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if new_tokens >= 1 then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    -- 有令牌，允许通过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    redis.call('HSET', key, 'tokens', new_tokens - 1, 'ts', now)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    redis.call('PEXPIRE', key, 60000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return 1  -- 允许</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    -- 桶空，拒绝</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    redis.call('HSET', key, 'tokens', new_tokens, 'ts', now)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return 0  -- 拒绝</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Lua 脚本在 Redis 中原子执行，避免并发问题（无需分布式锁）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"限流维度\">限流维度</h2><p>限流可以按不同维度计数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 按用户 ID 限流（消费用户的配额）&#10;rate_limit:&#10;  key: &#39;user_id:${user_id}&#39;&#10;  rate: 100/minute&#10;&#10;# 按 API Key 限流（控制第三方调用）&#10;rate_limit:&#10;  key: &#39;api_key:${api_key}&#39;&#10;  rate: 1000/hour&#10;&#10;# 按 IP 限流（防爬虫/DDoS）&#10;rate_limit:&#10;  key: &#39;ip:${remote_addr}&#39;&#10;  rate: 60/minute&#10;&#10;# 按路由 + 用户限流（精细化控制）&#10;rate_limit:&#10;  key: &#39;route:${route_id}:user:${user_id}&#39;&#10;  rate: 10/second\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 按用户 ID 限流（消费用户的配额）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">rate_limit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user_id:${user_id}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">100/minute</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 按 API Key 限流（控制第三方调用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">rate_limit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'api_key:${api_key}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1000/hour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 按 IP 限流（防爬虫/DDoS）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">rate_limit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ip:${remote_addr}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">60/minute</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 按路由 + 用户限流（精细化控制）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">rate_limit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'route:${route_id}:user:${user_id}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">10/second</span></span></code></pre></div><p>不同维度可以叠加：先检查 IP 级别，再检查用户级别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"响应格式与-headers\">响应格式与 Headers</h2><p>被限流的请求应返回 <strong>429 Too Many Requests</strong>，并附带标准 Headers 告知客户端何时重试：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"HTTP/1.1 429 Too Many Requests&#10;Content-Type: application/json&#10;X-RateLimit-Limit: 100&#10;X-RateLimit-Remaining: 0&#10;X-RateLimit-Reset: 1720000060   # 窗口重置的 Unix 时间戳&#10;Retry-After: 45                 # 秒数，多久后可以重试&#10;&#10;{&#10;  &quot;error&quot;: &quot;rate_limit_exceeded&quot;,&#10;  &quot;message&quot;: &quot;请求速率超限，请 45 秒后重试&quot;,&#10;  &quot;retry_after&quot;: 45&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>HTTP/1.1 429 Too Many Requests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Type: application/json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X-RateLimit-Limit: 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X-RateLimit-Remaining: 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X-RateLimit-Reset: 1720000060   # 窗口重置的 Unix 时间戳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Retry-After: 45                 # 秒数，多久后可以重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"error\": \"rate_limit_exceeded\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"message\": \"请求速率超限，请 45 秒后重试\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"retry_after\": 45</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"限流与服务分级\">限流与服务分级</h2><p>生产系统通常对不同层级的用户设置不同配额：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>用户层级</th>\n<th>配额</th>\n<th>特权</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>免费用户</td>\n<td>100 req/hour</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准用户</td>\n<td>10,000 req/hour</td>\n<td>优先队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>企业用户</td>\n<td>无限制（配合 SLA）</td>\n<td>专用实例</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>网关从 Token/API Key 中读取用户层级，动态选择对应的配额配置。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Req[请求] --&gt; Auth[认证 + 提取 tier]&#10;    Auth --&gt;|tier=free| RL_Free[100/hour]&#10;    Auth --&gt;|tier=standard| RL_Std[10k/hour]&#10;    Auth --&gt;|tier=enterprise| RL_Ent[unlimited]&#10;    RL_Free --&gt;|通过| US[上游服务]&#10;    RL_Std --&gt;|通过| US&#10;    RL_Ent --&gt; US&#10;    RL_Free --&gt;|超限| 429[429 Response]\">graph LR\n    Req[请求] --&gt; Auth[认证 + 提取 tier]\n    Auth --&gt;|tier=free| RL_Free[100/hour]\n    Auth --&gt;|tier=standard| RL_Std[10k/hour]\n    Auth --&gt;|tier=enterprise| RL_Ent[unlimited]\n    RL_Free --&gt;|通过| US[上游服务]\n    RL_Std --&gt;|通过| US\n    RL_Ent --&gt; US\n    RL_Free --&gt;|超限| 429[429 Response]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>网关限流是保护后端的第一道防线。令牌桶算法（允许合理突发 + 长期速率控制）是最常用的算法，用 Redis+Lua 实现原子性的分布式计数。限流应按多个维度（IP、用户、API Key）分层叠加，对不同用户层级设置不同配额。被限流时返回规范的 429 响应并附带重试时间。网关的故障隔离机制见下一篇<a href=\"circuit-breaking-retry\">熔断与重试</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"限流与节流策略：网关如何控制请求速率","id":"限流与节流策略-网关如何控制请求速率"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么要在网关限流？","id":"为什么要在网关限流"},{"level":2,"text":"限流算法对比","id":"限流算法对比"},{"level":3,"text":"固定窗口计数器","id":"固定窗口计数器"},{"level":3,"text":"滑动窗口计数器（Sliding Window Log）","id":"滑动窗口计数器-sliding-window-log"},{"level":3,"text":"令牌桶（Token Bucket）","id":"令牌桶-token-bucket"},{"level":3,"text":"Redis + Lua 的令牌桶实现","id":"redis-lua-的令牌桶实现"},{"level":2,"text":"限流维度","id":"限流维度"},{"level":2,"text":"响应格式与 Headers","id":"响应格式与-headers"},{"level":2,"text":"限流与服务分级","id":"限流与服务分级"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"TLS 终止与证书管理：网关的 HTTPS 安全基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/security/tls-certificate-management"},"next":{"title":"熔断与重试：网关的故障隔离机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/resilience/circuit-breaking-retry"}}